testcase.system-out:
* paymentsUrl Given 'payments' And { amount: 12500, currency: 'USD', card: { number: '4242424242424242', expiry: '12/29' } } When post request: 2026-11-27T11:19:03.601Z 1 > POST http://localhost:42515/payments 1 > Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8 1 > Host: localhost:42515 1 > Content-Length: 88 1 > Connection: keep-alive 1 > User-Agent: Apache-HttpClient/5.6.5 (Java/21.0.13.1) { "amount": 12500, "currency": "USD", "card": { "number": "4242424242424242", "expiry": "12/29" } }
response: 68ms 1 < 201 POST http://localhost:42515/payments 1 < Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8 1 < Karate-Mock: true 1 < content-length: 83 1 < vary: origin { "id": "pay-1", "status": "approved", "amount": 12500, "currency": "USD", "network": "VISA" }
Then 201 And response == { id: '#string', status: 'approved', amount: 12500, currency: 'USD', network: '#string' }

